{"timestamp":"2026-05-31T07:36:24.209Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"function_call_output","call_id":"call_38LIxmMK0ENyAAtaSNzyvQKh","output":"Chunk ID: 352f53\nWall time: 0.0000 seconds\nProcess exited with code 0\nOriginal token count: 1078\nOutput:\n\nfunc _stamp_cutout(file_name: String, origin: Vector2i, footprint: Vector2i, blocked: bool = true, z: int = 7) -> void:\n\tvar texture := _texture(FANTASY_CUTOUT_DIR + file_name)\n\tif texture == null:\n\t\treturn\n\tvar sprite := Sprite2D.new()\n\tsprite.name = \"Cutout_%s\" % file_name.get_basename()\n\tsprite.texture = texture\n\tsprite.centered = false\n\tsprite.texture_filter = CanvasItem.TEXTURE_FILTER_NEAREST\n\tsprite.z_index = z\n\tsprite.position = Vector2(origin.x * TILE, origin.y * TILE)\n\tvar desired_size := Vector2(footprint.x * TILE, footprint.y * TILE)\n\tvar source_size := Vector2(texture.get_width(), texture.get_height())\n\tif source_size.x > 0 and source_size.y > 0:\n\t\tsprite.scale = Vector2(desired_size.x / source_size.x, desired_size.y / source_size.y)\n\tmap_root.add_child(sprite)\n\tif blocked:\n\t\t_block_rect_cells(Rect2i(origin, footprint))\n\nfunc _build_editor_json_map() -> void:\n\tvar map_data := _json_dict(EDITOR_MAP_JSON)\n\tvar godot_map := _browser_editor_map_dict()\n\tvar runtime_data = current_map.get(\"runtime_data\", {})\n\tif typeof(runtime_data) == TYPE_DICTIONARY:\n\t\tgodot_map = runtime_data\n\tif godot_map.is_empty():\n\t\tgodot_map = _json_dict(GODOT_EDITOR_MAP_JSON)\n\tvar manifest := _json_dict(KENNEY_MAP_MANIFEST_JSON)\n\tvar game_rules := game_rules_cache\n\tif map_data.is_empty() and godot_map.is_empty():\n\t\treturn\n\tif manifest.is_empty():\n\t\treturn\n\n\tvar size_source := godot_map if not godot_map.is_empty() else map_data\n\tactive_map_w = max(1, int(size_source.get(\"cols\", MAP_W)))\n\tactive_map_h = max(1, int(size_source.get(\"rows\", MAP_H)))\n\tactive_cell_px = max(TILE, int(size_source.get(\"cell\", TILE)))\n\n\tvar asset_lookup: Dictionary = {}\n\tfor item in manifest.get(\"assets\", []):\n\t\tif typeof(item) == TYPE_DICTIONARY and item.has(\"id\"):\n\t\t\tasset_lookup[String(item.id)] = item\n\n\tif _is_world_overview_mode():\n\t\t_add_world_overview_background(godot_map)\n\t\t_add_world_overview_markers(godot_map)\n\t\t_border_editor_visible()\n\t\treturn\n\n\tfor fill_y in active_map_h:\n\t\tfor fill_x in active_map_w:\n\t\t\t_stamp_editor_asset(EDITOR_GROUND_ASSET_ID, asset_lookup, Vector2i(fill_x, fill_y), Vector2i(1, 1), false, -1)\n\n\tvar terrain_rows: Array = godot_map.get(\"terrain\", []) if not godot_map.is_empty() else map_data.get(\"terrain\", [])\n\tfor y in range(terrain_rows.size()):\n\t\tvar row = terrain_rows[y]\n\t\tif typeof(row) != TYPE_ARRAY:\n\t\t\tcontinue\n\t\tfor x in range(row.size()):\n\t\t\tvar cell = row[x]\n\t\t\tvar asset_id := _terrain_cell_asset_id(cell)\n\t\t\tvar cell_pos := Vector2i(x, y)\n\t\t\tif asset_id != \"\" and asset_id != EDITOR_GROUND_ASSET_ID:\n\t\t\t\t_stamp_editor_asset(asset_id, asset_lookup, cell_pos, Vector2i(1, 1), false, 0)\n\t\t\tif _terrain_cell_blocks(cell, asset_id):\n\t\t\t\t_block_cell_only(cell_pos)\n\n\t\t\t\t_update_runtime_camera_layout()\n\t\t\treturn\n\nfunc _json_dict(path: String) -> Dictionary:\n\tvar file := FileAccess.open(path, FileAccess.READ)\n\tif file == null:\n\t\tpush_error(\"Missing JSON: \" + path)\n\t\treturn {}\n\tvar parsed = JSON.parse_string(file.get_as_text())\n\tif typeof(parsed) != TYPE_DICTIONARY:\n\t\tpush_error(\"Invalid JSON dictionary: \" + path)\n\t\treturn {}\n\treturn parsed\n\nfunc _build_world_map(ground: TileMapLayer, route: TileMapLayer, object: TileMapLayer, decor: TileMapLayer) -> void:\n\t_fill_urban_water(object)\n\t_carve_island(ground, object)\n\t_draw_path(route, [\n\t\tVector2i(13, 14), Vector2i(20, 12), Vector2i(28, 12), Vector2i(35, 13),\n\t\tVector2i(42, 14), Vector2i(46, 18), Vector2i(43, 22), Vector2i(35, 23),\n\t\tVector2i(27, 21), Vector2i(20, 20), Vector2i(15, 18), Vector2i(13, 14